    "caption": "AMD stock jumped 5.3% to $530.14 on Wednesday while Nvidia stock fell 2.9% to $150.96, its lowest close since June 2025, the day after Nvidia's record $115.8B quarter.\nSince Nov 6, Nvidia is down 19.1% and AMD up 18.1%, even though Nvidia trades at 9.7x expected earnings and AMD at 33.1x. AMD also closed its $2.9B Taalas inference-chip deal.\n\nGet this week's five, free every Saturday → link in bio.\n\n#amd #nvda #semiconductors #chipstocks #nvidiaearnings\n\nSources: The Motley Fool (closes, Nov 18), Techi (Nov 18), Yahoo Finance (Nov 18), Stock Titan (Nov 18), Blockonomi (Nov 18), Ad-hoc News (Nov 18), MPA Mag (Fed dates, Nov 10). Not investment advice."
